          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">REPEATABLE. Select another Friendly Biological Unit Within 8&quot;, spend CP and apply one of the following effects:
- 1 CP: That Unit’s first used weapon gains the CRITICAL HIT (2). 
- 1 CP: That Unit ignores the Disengage penalty for the remainder of the Round. 
- 2 CP: Remove the Activation Marker from that Unit.</characteristic>
