                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Set a Fire Wall token Within 4&quot; in an unoccupied space. If a Unit&apos;s Leading Model&apos;s path of travel passes through this token, or if any model in a Unit ends either a Move, Deploy, Run, Charge, Disengage, or Close Ranks action, or is Set Within 1&quot; of this token, remove the Fire Wall token from the battlefield before executing that move. If you do, that Unit suffers HITS 5 (1). If that Unit performed a Charge action, it cannot resolve the IMPACT effect.</characteristic>
                        <characteristic name="Cost" typeId="e11e-d579-0142-8de4">Active (1 CP)</characteristic>
                      </characteristics>
                    </profile>
