                      <characteristics>
                        <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="1c06-5502-fb5a-616e">Target a Friendly Non-Engaged Unit on the battlefield (Line of Sight is not required). When this Unit resolves a Ranged Attack using the Shock Cannon weapon profile this Round, it may choose to ignore the weapon&apos;s standard Range characteristic. If it does, it may target an Enemy Unit that is Within 8&quot; of, and Visible to, a model of the selected Friendly Unit, treating that model as the acting model.</characteristic>
